NOVEMBER 7th 1981 - MILL HILL - CIVIL SERVICE CHAMPIONSHIP 7 MILE

Thirty years ago an up and coming Eric Hall won his first civil medal in this event. He later went on to the Olympic Games for Great Britain and his style was to be admired. At Mill Hill, Eric with a winning team medal placed 7th and in the same team John Hall finished 4th.

