JANUARY 2nd 1982 - BELGRAVE INTER CLUB 7 MILES

To use the excuse that the previous days meeting reduced the field would be far from the truth (6 competed in both) as would the clash of fixtures with the Met.Police match at Hayes (only 24 started). So have walkers lost interest?

