MARCH 20th 1982 - BEXLEY - CAMBRIDGE H. ROAD RELAY 6 x 3 MILES

Although with some thirty Club names entered and listed as one of the races in which the team for our own Belgrave Haig Relay is selected, this long standing annual event again tended to be ignored by the majority of our runners in the current trend of apathy towards competitions.

